WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
The diagram brings the two
quality missions together.

00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:07.040
AI-assisted engineering
and assurance of AI applications both

00:00:07.088 --> 00:00:10.880
need testable intent, independent
checks and operational learning.

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:14.560
Shared services can provide
those foundations while domain

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.240
teams own expected
behavior. Faster change,

00:00:18.293 --> 00:00:22.160
trustworthy outcomes and reuse
are ambitions to validate.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.160
The platform is valuable when teams
can inspect evidence and repeat

00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:29.440
useful work, rather than
simply generate more output.
